{"id":"d7f3a912-4c58-4b6e-8a1d-9e0f5c2b7a34","revision":0,"last_node_id":12,"last_link_id":15,"nodes":[{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,51],"size":[620,600],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 效果音效 (Stable Audio 3 small_sfx)\n\n**引擎**: Stable Audio 3 small_sfx (Stability AI)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/stable_audio_3_small_sfx.safetensors`（本地现成，零下载）\n**文本编码器**: `text_encoders/t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors`（type=`stable_audio`）\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音效提示词** → 正向 `CLIPTextEncode` 的 `text`\n- **秒数** → `EmptyLatentAudio` 的 `seconds`\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → CLIP 文本编码 → KSampler(lcm/8步/cfg1) → VAE 解码 → 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 为什么用 small_sfx 而不是 medium\n- `small_sfx` 是 Stability 专门为**短音效**蒸馏的变体：模型更小、推理更快，单声/短促音效更干净\n- `medium` 是通用大模型，擅长成曲，做短音效属于杀鸡用牛刀且易拖尾\n- 本工作流面向 **1–5 秒的一次性音效**（脚步、开门、手机震动…），故选 small_sfx\n\n### 参数要点\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1 / sampler lcm**：small 系列的官方蒸馏配方，不要改成 20 步 euler\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n- 提示词写**具体的声音事件**（\"金属汤匙碰到瓷碗的清脆一声\"），不要写抽象情绪\n\n### 与 0060 / 0061 的分工\n- **0060 背景音乐** → ACE-Step v1.5（成曲）\n- **0061 环境音效** → HunyuanVideo-Foley（画面/场景关联的长氛围）\n- **0062 效果音效** → Stable Audio 3 small_sfx（短促单声事件）"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 效果音效 (Stable Audio 3 small_sfx)\n\n**引擎**: Stable Audio 3 small_sfx (Stability AI)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/stable_audio_3_small_sfx.safetensors`（本地现成，零下载）\n**文本编码器**: `text_encoders/t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors`（type=`stable_audio`）\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音效提示词** → 正向 `CLIPTextEncode` 的 `text`\n- **秒数** → `EmptyLatentAudio` 的 `seconds`\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → CLIP 文本编码 → KSampler(lcm/8步/cfg1) → VAE 解码 → 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 为什么用 small_sfx 而不是 medium\n- `small_sfx` 是 Stability 专门为**短音效**蒸馏的变体：模型更小、推理更快，单声/短促音效更干净\n- `medium` 是通用大模型，擅长成曲，做短音效属于杀鸡用牛刀且易拖尾\n- 本工作流面向 **1–5 秒的一次性音效**（脚步、开门、手机震动…），故选 small_sfx\n\n### 参数要点\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1 / sampler lcm**：small 系列的官方蒸馏配方，不要改成 20 步 euler\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n- 提示词写**具体的声音事件**（\"金属汤匙碰到瓷碗的清脆一声\"），不要写抽象情绪\n\n### 与 0060 / 0061 的分工\n- **0060 背景音乐** → ACE-Step v1.5（成曲）\n- **0061 环境音效** → HunyuanVideo-Foley（画面/场景关联的长氛围）\n- **0062 效果音效** → Stable Audio 3 small_sfx（短促单声事件）"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":1,"type":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","pos":[740,51],"size":[480,570],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","type":"FALLINGTS_MD_TABLE","widget":{"name":"data"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[5]},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"STRING","slot_index":1,"links":[1,2]},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT","slot_index":2,"links":[3]},{"name":"整行数据","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"title":"MD 数据表 (效果音效)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"data":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0062_效果音效.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_手机震动","values":{"ID":"00001_手机震动","音效提示词":"手机扣在桌面上震动了一下，沉闷而短促的一声嗡鸣，桌面随之微微共振。","秒数":"2"}}}],"widgets_values_named":{"data":{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0062_效果音效.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_手机震动","values":{"ID":"00001_手机震动","音效提示词":"手机扣在桌面上震动了一下，沉闷而短促的一声嗡鸣，桌面随之微微共振。","秒数":"2"}}}}},{"id":2,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[1300,289],"size":[250,166],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[6]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":1,"links":[]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":2,"links":[7]}],"pro